From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: James Hilliard <james.hilliard1@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 21 Oct 2026 18:08:55 -0600
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] dt-bindings: clock: sun50i-h616: export the APB2 clock

Expose the existing APB2 clock ID for UART baud clock references.
Keep the existing clock numbering.

Link: https://lists.openwall.net/linux-kernel/2026/10/22/28
Signed-off-by: James Hilliard <james.hilliard1@gmail.com>
---
 include/dt-bindings/clock/sun50i-h616-ccu.h | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/include/dt-bindings/clock/sun50i-h616-ccu.h b/include/dt-bindings/clock/sun50i-h616-ccu.h
--- a/include/dt-bindings/clock/sun50i-h616-ccu.h
+++ b/include/dt-bindings/clock/sun50i-h616-ccu.h
@@ -11,6 +11,7 @@
 #define CLK_CPUX		21
 
 #define CLK_APB1		26
+#define CLK_APB2		27
 
 #define CLK_DE			29
 #define CLK_BUS_DE		30
